  <file id="dialogs\support\fo_slums1.txt" original="dialogs\support\fo_slums1.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="translated">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Look at you, pretty $(#boy/girl), walkin' around like you're the boss of the place. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Поглянь на тебе, красуне $(#хлопчику/дівчинці), ходиш, як господар цього місця. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>You... you look so tender and... *so* delicious.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ти... ти виглядаєш так ніжно і... *так* смачно.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Nice face you got there. It would be a shame if someone was to eat it. ::Coughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Гарне обличчя у тебе. Шкода, якби хтось його з'їв. ::Кашляє.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Old Mike got his right arm and leg bitten off the other day and died from bleedin'. Poor man.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Старий Майк втратив праву руку і ногу напередодні, і помер від кровотечі. Бідний чоловік.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>::The bum gives you a voracious stare.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">::Бродяга дивиться на вас хижим поглядом.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I'm so hungry I could kill a man and eat him whole. $(#/Or a woman...)&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я такий голодний, що міг би вбити людину і з'їсти її цілком. $(#/Або жінку...)&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>My mother always told me not to play with my food. I'd take 'er advice if I had any.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Моя мати завжди казала мені не гратися з їжею. Я б послухав її пораду, якби мав її.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
  </file>
